My task is nearly done.
Then a code is requested on the screen.
It is written in the instructions: 'The code is sent via SMS.'
The time is counted down on the screen.
I wait very patiently.
Soon, the time runs out.
But the SMS message is not received.
I look at the window.
Outside, the rain is falling continuously.
Drops of water fall on the glass.
Usually, these servers work with a delay at night.
So I try one more time.
I request a fresh code.
The time is counted on the screen again.
I want to enter that code on the mobile.
But the second code never comes either.
